WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
<v Interviewer>How does the night shift get its work?

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:19.000
<v Hassan>The plan comes at six and by midnight it is wrong. We re-sequence the cards ourselves and tell Planning in the morning.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
<v Interviewer>And the technicians, how do they take to new tools?

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:36.000
<v Hassan>The technicians do what I tell them. If I say the new tablet is fine, they use it. If I say it's rubbish, it's in a drawer by Friday.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.000
<v Interviewer>What about the licensed engineers?

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:50.000
<v Hassan>Everybody asks Raj. He signs the release, so what he thinks is what happens.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.000
<v Interviewer>Anyone else who shapes the shift's view?

00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:06.000
<v Hassan>The union rep sits in the canteen at shift change. Whatever is said there is the shift's view by morning. That is what I have seen, I could not tell you how he gets it.
